# Showing Scorecard License

Copyright 2026 Sarah Arlington, Rooster Homes.

## What you may do

Use this in your own real estate business, free, for as many clients as you like.

Change it. Add your own must-have lists, your own market's inspection prompts, your own
buyer types.

Put **your** colors, logo and wording on the scorecards it produces. That is what it is
for, and the output is yours. The skill itself keeps its credit line.

Give the scorecards you build with it to your own clients, including as part of paid
services you sell them.

Show it to other agents and point them at this repository.

## What you may not do

Do not redistribute **the skill itself**, or a modified version of it, as your own work
or under your own name. Point people here instead.

Do not sell **the skill itself**, or a derivative of it, as a product, a template pack,
a course asset or a paid bonus.

To be clear about what is not restricted, because the line matters:

- Using it with clients and with prospective clients is unrestricted, including to win
  business you have not won yet.
- An installed copy living inside your own project or your own repository is fine, public
  or private. That is how the tool is installed and it is not redistribution.
- The scorecards you generate are yours. Give them away, attach them to anything, use
  them to get hired.

Do not remove the credit line from `SKILL.md` or from this file.

## Credit

Keep this line wherever the skill lives:

> Showing Scorecard, built by Sarah Arlington, Rooster Homes.

Scorecards you generate for your own clients carry your branding, not hers. The credit
belongs on the skill, not on the page your buyer sees.

